<table width="720" class="MsoNormalTable" style="width: 7.5in; mso-cellspacing: 1.5pt; background: white; border: solid #E5E5E5 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid #E5E5E5 .75pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 10.5pt 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;" border="1" cellpadding="0">
<tbody>
<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;">
<td>
<div style="float: left;"></div>
<p><img src="https://messagecenter.intel.com/v1/images/uploads/0942c890-2a3f-11eb-9811-c9215fbc3413.jpg" alt="" title="Banner_Img.jpg" /></p>
<p></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 9.0pt .75pt 3.75pt 35.25pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"> Welcome to Intel Retail Partner Solutions Hub! </span></b></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">The Retail Hub is one of the first steps we are taking to provide you with a greater customer experience when interacting with our tools, enabling you to work with us in a simpler and more efficient way. The Retail Hub provides you with access to your work in one location, through Single Sign-On.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 30.0pt .75pt 27.75pt;">
<div align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 15.0pt;"><hr width="100%" size="1" align="center" style="color: #e5e5e5;" noshade="noshade" /></div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td id="emailMainDiv" style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt .75pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Action Required </span></b></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">This notice is to inform you that you have been registered as a representative of </span><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #0070c0;"> {!Account.Name}</span><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"> by an Intel Representative</span>.</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">An account has been generated that will allow you to access Intel’s <a href="https://cqpreview.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/retail/partner-solutions/overview.html">Retail Partner Solutions Hub</a>. Please follow the instructions below to get started. <br /></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Please retain this e-mail for future reference. </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">E-mail Address:</b> </span><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #0070c0;">{!Contact.Email}</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt .75pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">What you need to do </span></b></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Go to Intel’s <a href="https://cqpreview.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/retail/partner-solutions/overview.html">Retail Partner Solutions Hub</a> and login with your existing Intel account.<br /> If you are unsure of your login details, you will be able to request your email login page.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">If you feel you have received this e-mail in error, please contact us <a href="http://www.intel.com/p/en_US/support"> here</a>.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Visit this <a href="https://!%ssl_us_en%!"> link</a> any time to manage your profile.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt .75pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #62686e;">Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail message. This is an automated response.<br /> To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, please add us to your address book. </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 30.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<div align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 15.0pt;"><hr width="100%" size="1" align="center" style="color: #e5e5e5;" noshade="noshade" /></div>
</td>
</tr>
